; ASSERT carries Emuera's DEBUG_FUNC flag
; (GameProc/Function/FunctionIdentifier.cs:372), so outside debug mode the line
; is skipped without its argument ever being parsed
; (GameProc/Process.ScriptProc.cs:33-40) and a zero argument cannot fire.
; It still occupies a statement slot: Emuera cannot treat it as a comment line
; 「SIF文のためにコメント行扱いにはできない」, so the SIF below must take the
; skipped ASSERT as its body and the line after it must still run.
@SYSTEM_TITLE
PRINTFORML start
ASSERT 1 - 1
SIF 1
	ASSERT 0
PRINTFORML end
